## Customer order entpoints

@host = localhost:8080/api/v1/customer-orders

### Create new order
POST {{host}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 7,
  "quantity": 20,
  "addressId": 1,
  "orderItems": [
    {
      "quantity": 15,
      "productId": 3,
      "unitPrice": 400.0
    }
  ]
}

### Update order status
PATCH {{host}}/8/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_PREPARATION"
}

### Get by Customer
GET {{host}}/customer/7

### Get all orders
GET {{host}}/

### Get order by id
GET {{host}}/7

### Delete order
DELETE {{host}}/7